<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Turkish Revenge, 2012</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;In&amp;nbsp;June 2012, Syrian air defenses shot down a Turkish RF-4, killing both crew and setting the tone for the confrontational Ankara-Damascus relationship that involved the TuAF shooting down multiple Syrian aircraft, and, most recently, a Russian Su-24.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario involves the Turks hitting back at sea instead, with a submarine being deployed to sink two Syrian corvettes. However, the Assad regime and its allies are prepared for any counterattack...&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Scenario by Coiler12.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
